- Yes, the early turnup is what matters.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.300
- What?

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.390
I actually don't drink in the morning.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.710
- Steven goes home on a Friday

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.350
