00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.220
(laughs)

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.720
- That's correct.
- [Curly] You gotta live life.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.270
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.220
- Today we're going to get brunch.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.570
