00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.850
in the weekend where you can get

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.780
that last little smidge of fun.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.770
(ding)
(pop)

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.950
