favorite thing in life.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.810
(ding)
(pop)

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.830
What kind of bunch do you usually go to?

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:31.830
- Chinese brunch.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.500
- Chinese brunch is the best.
- [Curly] That sounds good.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.620
