00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.282
- Me neither.

00:00:35.282 --> 00:00:36.130
(ding)
(pop)

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:42.550
(cheerful band music)

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:44.400
- [Freddie] Let's go, guys.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.280
- [Steven] Let's go, let's get outta here.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:45.920
(woos)

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.740
We're goin' to the San Gabriel Valley.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.170
- Are you?

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.250
Do you ever go to the San Gabriel Valley?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:53.980
What?

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:54.480
(laughs)

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.750
- Hot box.
- [Steven] There might not

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.700
be AC, I don't think
there is AC in this place.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:00:59.820
