00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.550
is my favorite.
- [Freddie] I'm thinking no

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.260
AC, no booze, and really far out.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.150
This has to be super authentic.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.060
- [Steven] We're at our
first place for brunch.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:08.540
Huge Tree Pastry.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:09.800
What is your first impression of this?

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:10.790
- [Curly] I think it looks beautiful.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.080
- I think this looks really exciting.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.900
- [Steven] It's called
Fan Tuan in Mandarin.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.400
(ding)

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.480
- [Curly] Holy shit, yes.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.330
- Yeah, this rice casing
is really, really good.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:19.120
- You kinda taste the
egg, it's a little sweet.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.202
I like the texture of the rice

00:01:20.202 --> 00:01:21.460
'cause the rice is a little harder.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:22.100
- A little bit.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:22.760
It's like a reverse burrito.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:23.920
This is my childhood, right?

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.480
You take it and dip it in the soy milk.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.150
- [Freddie] Whoa.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:29.700
- Mmm.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.940
- It's like a churro and a funnel cake

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.050
