00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.510
- Beef noodle soup.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.130
♫ Beef noodle soup ♫

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.570
- [Freddie] I picture
myself in the winter though,

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.100
sitting by a fire eating this.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.600
My favorite was that first
little number we had.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.940
- Was it Fun Tuan?

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:44.940
'Cause it was a lot of fun.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:45.610
- Yeah.

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:47.980
- My idea of brunch is just family time.

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:48.740
- [Curly] You're so sweet.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:51.490
- Mom and dad and your siblings
that you don't see all week.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:52.950
- This is why you have a
girlfriend and I'm single.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:53.700
(laughs)

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.330
- What's next on our agenda?

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:56.080
- I think your place.

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:57.170
