00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.220
You mainly come just to get drinks

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.260
and chat and catch up on the weekends,

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.250
but a lot of times we'll
get the banana bread

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:17.093
or the pancakes, so I am
going to share some seafood

00:02:17.093 --> 00:02:19.810
with my friends and some tasty drinks.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:22.650
- I don't drink, but because I'm here,

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.760
Freddie, I'll make an exception for you.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.940
- And I do drink, so let's do this.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.140
- Woo!

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:33.342
- Brunch is a very impromptu thing.

00:02:33.342 --> 00:02:36.210
We try and get cute but
it's a lived-in cute

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.052
'cause we're still--
- [Curly] 'Cause you're still

00:02:37.052 --> 00:02:37.840
cute.
- [Freddie] Yeah.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.870
