00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.130
- [Curly] It's so good.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:46.980
It's a little buttery...

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:48.414
- [Freddie] It kinda just slides on down.

00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:50.260
- And now they really care
about the fish, right?

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.020
- I'm stoked.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.700
- Here's how we'll do
this, I'll get one piece.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:54.590
- Go ahead, Papa.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.190
- And you guys share this piece.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.750
- It's so good, I mean...

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.220
- Is that how we're doin' things?

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.330
- He's drunk, leave him alone, he's drunk.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.320
- Okay, he's drunk, yeah.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.552
- Look at all the wine I've had.

00:03:02.552 --> 00:03:03.980
One more question, have you ever met

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.110
the man of your dreams at a brunch?

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:08.610
