00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.660
- Just orange juice with a kick in it.

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:55.410
- Cheers, guys.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:55.950
- Cheers.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.614
- Cheers.

